#: toner_tab.py:2101
msgid "Calibration Capture"
msgstr ""

#: toner_tab.py:2102
msgid ""
"Calibration walks through every note in the saxophone's range, one at a "
"time.\n"
"\n"
"How it works:\n"
"  • A 10-second countdown gives you time to get ready\n"
"  • A large note name appears on screen\n"
"  • Play that note and hold it steady\n"
"  • The app records for 5 seconds, then waits for silence\n"
"  • Stop playing, and the next note appears\n"
"  • Work through all 32 notes at your own pace\n"
"\n"
"Tips:\n"
"  • Use Pause if you need to adjust or take a break\n"
"  • Play at a comfortable mezzo-forte dynamic\n"
"  • If the app triggers on chair noise, raise the\n"
"    capture threshold in Options > Capture Threshold"
msgstr ""

